    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d666-a2">

                <pb facs="0814" n="706" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg706"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    114.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Grand Vizier to Mr.
                            Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Office of the Grand Vizier</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November
                                26, 1893</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Envoy</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt, with its inclosure, of the letter which your excellency has been
                    pleased to address to me.</p>
                <p>The subject which you mention is under consideration at the council of ministers,
                    and I will not fail to communicate the result of our deliberations. Please
                    accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Djevad.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
